  "about": {
    "pl": "Introit II Niedzieli Adwentu, z Izajasza, z wersetem Psalmu 79. Antyfona zwraca się do ludu Syjonu i mówi, po co Pan przychodzi — zbawić narody, i dać usłyszeć swój głos.",
    "en": "The introit of the Second Sunday of Advent, from Isaias, with a verse of Psalm 79. The antiphon addresses the people of Sion and says what the Lord comes for — to save the nations, and to let His voice be heard."
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "type": "verse",
      "speaker": "schola",
      "voice": "cantus",
      "participation": {
