          "gradus": 4,
          "source": "DMS 31 d"
        },
        "cantu": {
          "gradus": 3,
          "source": "DMS 25 c"
        }
      },
      "translation": {
        "pl": "Ludu Syjonu, oto Pan przyjdzie, aby zbawić narody; Pan pozwoli wam usłyszeć chwałę swojego głosu ku radości waszych serc.",
        "en": "O people of Sion, behold, the Lord will come to save the nations; the Lord will make the glory of His voice heard for the joy of your hearts."
      },
